{"articleNo":"135105","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=135105&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2015학년도 연구봉사장학금 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2015.08.25","hit":"6027","attachments":[{"name":"연구봉사장학생 추천 명단 서식.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=135105&attachNo=4479"},{"name":"2015 연구봉사장학금 지급 계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=135105&attachNo=4489"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><!--StartFragment--></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2015학년도 연구봉사장학금 신청 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -13.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 신청대상 및 자격</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 해당 학부의 교수가 진행하고 있는 연구과제에 학부연구생으로 참여하고 있거나, 참여를 </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;희망하는 </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3, 4학년 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ 현재 연구보조원으로 등록되지 않은 경우, 신청기간 내에 등록한 후 추천 가능</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(단, 참여예정인 경우는 선발확정후 참여확인서 제출)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -36.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 36.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직전학기의 이수 학점은 15학점 이상(다만 4학년은 8학점 이상), 평점평균은 3.0이상인 학생</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -150.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 150.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 신청 제외 대상 : </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">ACE사업 연구실 레지던트 프로그램 참여 예정자, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">계약학과 및 외국인학생,</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학기초과자, 직전학기 징계처분을 받은 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">연구 참여기간 : <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 6. 1(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">일</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양신명조\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 12. 31(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;※ 연구과제 참여 기간은 최소 4개월 이상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">연구봉사장학금 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015. 8. 25(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 9. 2(수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\">까지</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 장학생 선발인원 : 60명 내외</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -20.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 장학금액 : 1,200,000원(2015-2학기 등록금범위 초과 중복수혜 가능)</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -20.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 장학금 지급 : 2015년 1월 예정</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -20pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 20pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. 장학생 선발 절차</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학생은 연구봉사장학생 신청서[별지 서식 2]를 작성하여 연구과제교수 및&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학부장의</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;추천을 받아 해당학부(과) 행정실로 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -33pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학부(과)장은 학부 자체 심사를 거쳐 장학생을 선발, 학생처로 추천명단 및 신청서를</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -33pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 공문으로 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학생처는 학부(과) 추천 순으로 배정된 인원을 장학생으로 선발하고, 미달인원이 있을시 </span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -33.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 후보자 중에서 직전학기 이수학점과 평점평균이 높은 순으로</span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 장학생을 선발하여</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;해당 학부(과)로 통보</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -33pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 33pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;* 장학생 선발 결과 : 2015. 9월 중순 예정</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -15.7pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 15.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">8. 의무사항 : </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">장학생으로 선발된 학생은 연구참여기간 종료 후 참여 결과보고서[별지 서식 3]를 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">제출하여야 한다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -19.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">9. 기타</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -19.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">학부(과)별 추천인원 배정 현황 : 붙임</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -19.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">교수 1인당 1과제이내 지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -19.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -19.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">금오공대 학생처</span></span></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
